<!-- Status-bar notification icon for the reveal push.
     Android renders this as a SILHOUETTE: every non-transparent pixel is
     painted with the accent colour and everything else is dropped. So it
     must be white-on-transparent and shape-only — a full-colour launcher
     icon comes out as a solid white square, which is what shipped before
     this existed.
     Two overlapping rings: the duel/reveal motif from the design spec. -->
